{
  "id": "E237",
  "title": "Which Is More Powerful",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2018-07-07",
  "synopsis": "Who’s really “lihai”: the French or Lili’s mother?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/780/02e93579d56ebce102507093901b6e20c4ccb3f7.mp3?1530694241",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "厉害\n\n李力：安妮，昨天的球赛看了吗？\n安妮：看了，法国队太厉害了。他们五比零赢了中国队。\n李力：是吗？我也好想看！\n安妮：什么？你错过了这么精彩的比赛？\n李力：你知道的，我妈太厉害了，我可不敢熬夜看球。\n安妮：哈哈，你妈妈和法国队，哪个厉害？",
    "traditional": "厲害\n\n李力：安妮，昨天的球賽看了嗎？\n安妮：看了，法國隊太厲害了。他們五比零贏了中國隊。\n李力：是嗎？我也好想看！\n安妮：什麼？你錯過了這麼精彩的比賽？\n李力：你知道的，我媽太厲害了，我可不敢熬夜看球。\n安妮：哈哈，你媽媽和法國隊，哪個厲害？"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Powerful"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "李力：安妮，昨天的球赛看了吗？",
      "traditional": "李力：安妮，昨天的球賽看了嗎？",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì ān nī zuó tiān de qiú sài kàn le ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Anne, did you watch yesterday’s game?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "安妮：看了，法国队太厉害了。他们五比零赢了中国队。",
      "traditional": "安妮：看了，法國隊太厲害了。他們五比零贏了中國隊。",
      "pinyin": "ān nī kàn le fǎ guó duì tài lì hai le tā men wǔ bǐ líng yíng le zhōng guó duì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: I did, the French team is so awesome. They beat the Chinese team by five to zero."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "李力：是吗？我也好想看！",
      "traditional": "李力：是嗎？我也好想看！",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì shì ma wǒ yě hǎo xiǎng kàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: Really? I also wanted to watch it!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "安妮：什么？你错过了这么精彩的比赛？",
      "traditional": "安妮：什麼？你錯過了這麼精彩的比賽？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī shén me nǐ cuò guò le zhè me jīng cǎi de bǐ sài",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: What? Did you miss such a wonderful game?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "李力：你知道的，我妈太厉害了，我可不敢熬夜看球。",
      "traditional": "李力：你知道的，我媽太厲害了，我可不敢熬夜看球。",
      "pinyin": "lǐ lì nǐ zhī dào de wǒ mā tài lì hai le wǒ kě bù gǎn áo yè kàn qiú",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Li Li: You know, my mother is very strict. I can't watch a game late at night."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "安妮：哈哈，你妈妈和法国队，哪个厉害？",
      "traditional": "安妮：哈哈，你媽媽和法國隊，哪個厲害？",
      "pinyin": "ān nī hā hā nǐ mā ma hé fǎ guó duì nǎ ge lì hai",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Annie: Haha, your mother or the French team, which is more powerful?"
    }
  ],
